From 0b14ca4919de84c002e5187c5671f41800521f0b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jev-router-ci <jev-router-ci@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 13:00:20 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] plugins: apply the onRoute thinking selection to the request
 body

A plugin may return {thinking:{control,native}} from onRoute: effort writes reasoning_effort, budget writes thinking.budget_tokens, toggle writes thinking.enabled/disabled. The native value is the model's own vocabulary (the plugin maps/clamps it), conflicting effort fields are removed, and the body is copied so combo targets never share mutation. Values are allowlisted; malformed selections are ignored.
